  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "How the employer suggestions from [#70](https://github.com/activescott/job-accelerator/pull/70) turn out ([#74](https://github.com/activescott/job-accelerator/issues/74)). Read from the worker's and app's `employer_suggest*` log events in Loki; every value is an id, a count or a label. To look at a wrong guess, take its `employerId` or `clientEmployerId` to the database. Counts are per run: an employer suggested again in a later run is checked, and counted, again."
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 3,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 1
    },
